{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"cuimao-e-o089","title":"积五年太祖定冀州，邢颙劝田畴以身先归附，遂装还乡里","accounts":[{"id":"cuimao-a-b55100760dab8046ef91","label":"正文","text":"邢颙向田畴说民厌乱、乱极则平，请以身先，遂装还乡里。","evidence":["cuimao-q-ad3a4f7b27e30a24fe12","cuimao-q2-d2539b23436915829033"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"定冀州者","evidence":["cuimao-q-ad3a4f7b27e30a24fe12"]},{"person":"cuimao-p0063","role":"请以身先，装还乡里","evidence":["cuimao-q-ad3a4f7b27e30a24fe12","cuimao-q2-d2539b23436915829033"]},{"person":"wudi-p0243","role":"被劝者","evidence":["cuimao-q-ad3a4f7b27e30a24fe12"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["cuimao-q-ad3a4f7b27e30a24fe12"]},"ordering_evidence":"cuimao-q-ad3a4f7b27e30a24fe12","source_order":[12,260,42],"order":2802}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"cuimao-p0063","name":"邢颙","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0243","name":"田畴","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"cuimao-q-ad3a4f7b27e30a24fe12","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-fcee2600a748b8b0406a","layer":"original","quote":"积五年，而太祖定冀州；颙谓畴曰：“黄巾起来二十余年〖2〗，海内鼎沸，百姓流离。今闻曹公法令严；民厌乱矣，乱极则平：请以身先。”遂装还乡里","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":259,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":42,"end":110},{"id":"cuimao-q2-d2539b23436915829033","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-fcee2600a748b8b0406a","layer":"original","quote":"邢颙，字子昂，河间鄚人也〖1〗。举孝廉，司徒辟，皆不就。易姓字，适右北平，从田畴游。积五年，而太祖定冀州；颙谓畴曰：“黄巾起来二十余年〖2〗，海内鼎沸，百姓流离。今闻曹公法令严；民厌乱矣，乱极则平：请以身先。”遂装还乡里〖3〗。田畴曰：“邢颙，民之先觉也。”乃见太祖，求为乡导，以克柳城。","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":259,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":144}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
